From: hawkff <109485367+hawkff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:11:50 +0000
Subject: Give the ad blocking subpages a settings page title

The Filter lists, Custom filters, Custom filter lists and Allowed sites
pages set the window title themselves. Settings did not know about it,
so after Back the Ad blocking page still showed the title of the page
that was closed.

The pages now provide their title the way settings pages do, and
settings shows the right title when a page opens and after Back.

